[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11641.59, "timestamp": "03:14:01", "text": "他们的想象力引导他们走向……正确的？和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11643.269, "timestamp": "03:14:03", "text": "当然，当然，会有的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11650.389, "timestamp": "03:14:10", "text": "东西。人们有时会有相同的经历。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11652.55, "timestamp": "03:14:12", "text": "考虑到设计，他们的想法是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11655.389, "timestamp": "03:14:15", "text": "把副本说出来。确切地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11658.87, "timestamp": "03:14:18", "text": "是的。耻辱。这和……是一样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11660.75, "timestamp": "03:14:20", "text": "设计为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11664.309, "timestamp": "03:14:24", "text": "出色地。设计，以及类似标志和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11666.55, "timestamp": "03:14:26", "text": "东西。我认为颜色方面就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11668.389, "timestamp": "03:14:28", "text": "tra商标之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11670.79, "timestamp": "03:14:30", "text": "我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11673.11, "timestamp": "03:14:33", "text": "我忘了还有调色板这回事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11674.95, "timestamp": "03:14:34", "text": "例如版权或商标或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11675.68, "timestamp": "03:14:35", "text": "某物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11678.269, "timestamp": "03:14:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11681.19, "timestamp": "03:14:41", "text": "没错，哈莉·奎茵并不意味着他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11683.51, "timestamp": "03:14:43", "text": "模仿她。是的，大多数人都这么说。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11687.75, "timestamp": "03:14:47", "text": "嗯，加维斯是普拉的儿子，或者类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11691.269, "timestamp": "03:14:51", "text": "女儿。对，儿子什么的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11694.95, "timestamp": "03:14:54", "text": "孩子之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11697.229, "timestamp": "03:14:57", "text": "但这并不意味着"}]